WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.940
Time to eat!

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:15.450
I wonder if Yuu-kun's arrived home yet.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:51.920
<b>Episode 3: The Knight and the Pact</b>

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:56.130
You realize I still haven't 
granted the wish you're due

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.380
as a reward for forging 
a pact with a knight, right?

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:00.360
Yeah.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.610
It would be possible to cure 
your grandfather's illness.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.060
I might just ask you to kill him.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:13.150
What happened between you 
and your grandfather?

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.020
I was raised by Grandpa.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.400
Three times a day he would warn me,

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.720
"Don't make enemies. 
They'll stab you in your gut."

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:23.370
"Don't make friends. 
They'll stab you in your back."

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.300
"People are all scumbags, even you and me,"

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.150
for ten whole years straight.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.340
Why are you staying in the guest 
room at your own home?

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.840
Because my cousin Koishi is using my room.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.400
When I went off to college,

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.530
my aunt got worried 
about Grandpa living all alone,

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.270
so now her family lives here.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:51.040
Your aunt?

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.230
What about your parents?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.400
Yeah, about that...

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:59.670
Yuu-nii, dinner's ready.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.570
Time to eat!

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:07.290
Yuuhi, I made your favorite, karaage,

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.140
so eat up.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.660
Thank you.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.440
Mom, you made too much!

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.830
That was good.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.150
So getting back to earlier,

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:24.330
what about your parents?

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.390
Right.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.810
My father and mother are already gone.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.320
I don't know what to say.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:41.650
My father was a detective, 
and one day, he went MIA.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:45.860
Several months later, they 
caught a guy smuggling guns

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:49.300
who confessed to killing a detective 
who witnessed a deal going down

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.530
and dumping his body in the mountains.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.040
The detective he disposed of was my father,

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.750
and the man who was caught was his partner.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:02.780
When mom heard that news, she had 
a mental breakdown and disappeared.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.100
Grandpa lost all hope in humanity

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.410
and raised me to avoid all 
interactions with people

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.640
so I wouldn't end up like my father.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:14.010
Whenever I went against his teachings 
he would chain me up

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:15.400
and lock me away.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:21.570
Crazy, right?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.840
So cruel it sounds like a joke.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.880
Look at your face, Yuuhi.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:31.290
You look like a crying child to me.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:34.460
I thought I was putting on a normal smile.

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.210
So who is it you hate?

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.270
Your grandpa?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.050
Your father's partner?

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.030
Your mother who left you and disappeared?

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.220
This entire world that created all of them.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:55.880
That's why I'll do anything 
to help the princess

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.490
destroy this world.

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:03.070
Cursing the world will only bring 
unhappiness upon yourself.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.800
I'm already too miserable to smile anymore.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.240
Dongo
Kawano
Hospital

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.850
Grandpa, I brought Yuu-nii.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.020
Hey.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.680
I forgot to buy something to drink.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.820
Yuu-nii, do you need anything?

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.570
No, I'm fine.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:26.470
Okay.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.280
There's strength in your eyes.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.640
You've found a place where you belong.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:44.990
A friend?

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.290
Don't be frightened. I won't do anything.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:06.860
After you left and I started 
living with Koishi's family,

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.760
I finally started to regain 
the smile I lost

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.740
when your parents left us.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.510
I don't have much longer in this world.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:20.140
Allow me one last selfish request. 
I want to apologize.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.250
Though I know I can never be forgiven.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.890
Of course not!

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.460
How could I forgive you?!

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.610
Apologizing now won't cut it!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:34.200
You think you can just take back 
every damn thing you did to me?

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.370
You're asking too much if you think

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.960
you can just bow your head 
and say you've reformed!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:44.750
Yuu-nii?

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.130
Screw you, Grandpa!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.720
Do you have any idea how sad I was 
when Mom and Dad were gone?!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.990
Yet you just took all your 
damn grief out on me!

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.500
When was I was supposed 
to be able to grieve?!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:59.060
Whose shoulder was I supposed 
to be able to cry on?!

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.150
H-How can this be?!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.050
Run!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.130
What power!

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:33.090
I'll die instantly if I take 
even a single punch.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.840
It's struggling to move around.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.930
Running into the mountains 
was the right choice.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.930
Though you've been running 
for over an hour now.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.530
Aren't you at your limit?

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.610
When I hit my limit, I die.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:55.200
Golems have unlimited stamina.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.420
Now matter how far you get 
ahead of it in these mountains,

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:58.650
it'll eventually catch up.

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.450
I have to...

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:16.760
have to do something...

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.350
There's nothing you can do.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.520
You have your Holding Field,

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.740
but that's like fighting a tank 
with a wooden sword.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.730
Its strength is on a different level.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.800
It's...

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.110
It's over for us, Yuuhi.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:37.910
No! Am I to be defeated partway 
through like this once more?!

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:40.620
Once more? What do you mean, once more?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.170
Shit!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.710
I'm passing out...

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:19.430
Being asleep means you 
won't suffer at the end.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.330
Farewell, Yuuhi.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:26.840
Where am I?

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.450
Hey, Yuu-kun.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.280
You're asleep already?

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:36.070
I ran into a golem.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:39.870
I got so exhausted after running away 
from it that I passed out.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.430
That's not good.

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:46.020
I'm glad I got to see you one last time, 
even if it's just a dream.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.050
I was so afraid of Grandpa's chains.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:53.540
But I can't live without any chains anymore.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.490
That's why I wanted it.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:00.110
Some absolute guide 
to tell me what I need to do.

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:01.450
Guide?

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.640
By swearing fealty to you,

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.440
I was trying to convince 
myself I could be bound

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.490
by new chains that weren't my grandpa's.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:14.570
I was just running from the 
responsibility of thinking for myself.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.970
I used you.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.080
I'm sorry for everything.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.290
Yuu-kun.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.220
Do you love me?

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.450
Huh?!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.550
Y-You're asking that now?!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.850
No, because of what's happening now?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:34.070
Yeah. Your reaction is proof enough.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.640
Though this ain't a problem that can 
be solved by ordering you to survive.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.440
So instead...

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:45.650
If you come back alive, 
I'll give you a kiss!

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:46.330
A kiss!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.690
Wha?!

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.150
N-Neither of us will remember this 
when we wake up, though!

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:55.380
Besides, the one I love 
is your cuter, outer persona.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.720
You insolent brat! They're both me!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.680
Now just get out there 
and do something about this!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.370
You woke back up?

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:06.940
How long was I out?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:08.980
A minute or two.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.230
I see. I feel like I slept for six hours.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:15.340
It's finally over for us.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.030
I can win now.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.300
What are you talking about?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.070
Let's go!

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:22.950
I'll overcome

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.650
this ordeal!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.750
You're pushing the rock 
with your Holding Field?

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.660
No good?

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:41.800
Your all-out attack only scratched it.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:47.110
Yuuhi, it's no use.

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.970
You're no match for it.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:52.760
I'm sorry for dragging you into this fight.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.400
I want to apologize.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.610
I'm sorry for everything.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.140
Don't apologize!

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.690
We won't die!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.560
I just told you, I'll overcome this ordeal!

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:04.940
Look at the golem's stomach.

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:09.660
It might be slight, but something other 
than the Princess's fist damaged it!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.090
That means it can be defeated!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.200
What's wrong?!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.490
Why are you stopping?!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.440
A cliff!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.650
This height...

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:26.250
You won't be able to make it down 
with your exhausted stamina.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:41.070
Wha?!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.390
How?!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:45.790
I used multiple short bursts

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:48.230
to decrease how long it was activated.

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:50.290
I barely used any stamina that way.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.040
It's coming after you!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.250
The fool.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:55.450
No matter how strong it is,

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:59.170
it can't use its monstrous force 
in mid-air where there's no footing.

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.760
Take a dive!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.100
So that's a golem?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.630
Not that impressive.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.480
Hello?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.010
<i>Yuu-nii! You finally answered!</i>

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:19.060
What's the matter?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.080
<i>Come back to the hospital at once!</i>

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.400
<i>Grandpa's...!</i>

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.930
<i>Grandpa is...!</i>

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.570
Grandpa?!

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:53.890
Call his doctor!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.920
Hang in there!

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:54.920
On it!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.500
What's the matter, Yuuhi?

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.790
I can't ever forgive my grandpa.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.160
Yuuhi...

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:15.120
Ten or so months with Koishi

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.940
reversed those ten years with me?

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.080
What the hell did I mean to him, then?!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:24.380
It may have been twisted,

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:27.040
but your grandfather loved you.

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:29.880
Love?

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.730
Love doesn't allow you to just 
get away with anything.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:36.600
That may be true, but...

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:46.700
I see. So you want to be 
a detective like your father?

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.480
Neu...

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:56.610
What is it?

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.290
Save my grandpa.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.340
Understood, my friend!

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.590
The knight's pact is now complete!

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:21.330
Let us face death together!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.400
Neu... Thank you.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:36.160
See? I made it back alive.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.210
At any rate, I'm glad you survived.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.170
Yeah, so am I.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.420
Wh-What?!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.960
I need to give you your reward.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:00.350
Oh, it's morning.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:07.980
What's that unsatisfied look for?

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:09.930
Well,

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.580
I feel like I just had 
a disappointing dream.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.060
Good morning.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:22.910
Yuu-kun!

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.510
Morning!

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:25.280
You hurt anywhere?

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:27.130
It's basically nothing,

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.880
but my muscles are all sore 
from running around the mountains.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.190
You'll need to train up more, then!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:40.320
47, 48, 49, 50!

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.380
All done!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.270
Look at you.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:45.880
<i>Ever since then,</i>

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.900
<i>I've felt a heat welling up 
from inside my chest</i>

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:51.340
<i>and filling me all the way 
to the nerves in my fingers.</i>

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.140
I can fight.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:56.050
I can fight against those golems.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.740
Okay, food time, food time!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.950
<i>I can help her.</i>

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.690
<i>I'll be Lucifer's right hand man!</i>

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:08.350
Hold it right there!

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.630
Yo!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.710
Nice to meet you two.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:13.940
Who are you?

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:15.180
My name is...

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.090
Hah!

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.630
...Shinonome Hangetsu!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.140
And...

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.540
Here, my card.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.610
I'm Amamiya Yuuhi.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.360
I'm Asahina Samidare.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.380
A hero of justice?

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:34.860
Hero of Justice!!
Superhero 
Shinonome Hangetsu

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.860
Oh! That has a great ring!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.530
Justice, huh?

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.570
You never change, Neu Crescent.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:43.090
Our greatest wish is to defeat that mage

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:45.720
and stop the Biscuit Hammer from falling.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:49.290
We should all keep a level head 
until we achieve that.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:51.100
The doggy talked!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.380
You're a knight?!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.670
Nice to see you, Princess.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.840
You, too, Lizard Knight.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:58.670
Ludo Chevalier.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.800
I'm a warrior.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.930
This is Saw. The Dog Knight.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.010
It's Ludo!

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.560
I noticed you two a while back,

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:08.980
but I debated how to make 
a cool appearance until today.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:12.870
Guess it ended up being 
a normal introduction.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.940
Sorry for the delay in joining you.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.770
You call that normal?

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:20.820
Uh-oh! I need to get to work!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.790
Let's talk at length next time!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:24.880
Let's go, Saw!

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.040
It's Ludo!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.280
What a funny man.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:40.650
That dog said you haven't changed, 
so do you two know each other?

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:43.640
We're both knights, so we 
should know each other.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.100
Should?

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.210
I don't remember him.

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:51.860
Though honestly, most of my memories 
prior to meeting you are fuzzy.

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:56.570
I only know the basics, 
even when it comes to our fight.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.310
The whole "save the world 
from the Biscuit Hammer

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:02.910
and protect our Princess from the mage," huh?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.900
I don't see how those are connected yet.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.500
Shinonome Hangetsu, huh?

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.840
If he's calling himself a hero of justice,

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.260
then I should keep a lid 
on the Princess' ambition.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.270
I guess it's not really 
worth worrying about.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:23.060
He seems dumb, so I doubt 
he'll be strong in battle.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.220
Hmm?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.590
Yuu-kun!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.560
On your way home?

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.200
Yeah. Let's go home together!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.100
Sure.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.950
Hey, listen to this!

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.260
Yesterday, my sister did 
something real funny!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:38.900
You're wide open!

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:45.490
Oh?

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:47.700
Hmph!

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:49.280
Whoop.

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:50.160
Huh?

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:56.670
Wh-What was that?!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.340
Hangetsu is a master 
of ancient martial arts.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.900
Neither monstrous strength 
nor lightning speed will work on him.

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.600
What a guy...

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.930
He's handling our Princess like she's a kid.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.690
This is no time to just watch!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:14.470
Stop them!

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:17.140
It'll be terrible if she lands 
even a single blow!

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:18.520
You want me to stop them?

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.510
But there's no opportunity 
for me to step in!

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.530
<i>In that case...</i>

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.280
Don't move! Unless you don't 
care what happens to him!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.830
A dog hostage?!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.380
Whoa, there.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.690
Phew.

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.920
I thought I canceled most of that impact,

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:46.090
but it still sent me flying so far.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.000
That was close!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.060
I thought I'd killed you!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:50.980
Wha?!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:54.030
So strong! Amazing!

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:55.270
How reassuring!

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:58.390
Sorry about that.

00:20:58.390 --> 00:20:59.980
I was just testing her a bit.

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:02.940
I wanted to gauge the so-called 
powerful princess for myself.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:07.410
Looks like you're just relying 
on sheer physical might.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:08.960
Amamiya.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:11.740
Do you plan on resorting 
to these same tactics

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.620
when the Princess is fighting a golem?

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.460
That's empty strength.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.400
You're the lowest of the low.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.420
Uh-oh!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.620
I need to get to my next job!

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.370
Later!

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.290
The hero of justice, Shinonome Hangetsu!

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.270
That's one funny man!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.400
You look crude, laughing 
with your mouth open like that.

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:46.130
Hmph, you did say you loved 
my more refined outer persona.

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:48.570
Uh, is it really refined?

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:53.410
You're just grumpy because you couldn't 
show off for my outer persona, right?

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:56.630
And are you okay after 
fighting him like that?

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.850
Am I okay?

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:05.800
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.560
The reward I failed to give you yesterday.

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.590
There's no time to waste on being upset.

00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:22.020
Get stronger, for my sake, too.

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:24.730
I'll have to grow even stronger, too.

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:27.950
if I want to crush the world.

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:31.650
What's the matter?

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:35.200
Well, it just feels like I had a nice dream.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:37.210
Sounds pretty good to me.

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:39.810
You were rather mopey when you went to bed.

00:22:41.930 --> 00:22:43.960
Feeling bad for myself 
won't change anything.

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:47.370
It's more important that I get stronger.

00:22:48.530 --> 00:22:50.490
As Lucifer's right hand.

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:27.480
<b>Next Episode:
Asahina Hisame and Shinonome Hangetsu</b>
